        {
          "id": "GH-04-K02-check-q1",
          "type": "single",
          "question": "已知函数 f(x)=x^2·sin x，下列关于其导函数 f'(x) 的表达式正确的是哪一项？",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "A",
              "label": "f'(x)=2x·cos x"
            },
            {
              "value": "B",
              "label": "f'(x)=2x·sin x + x^2·cos x"
            },
            {
              "value": "C",
              "label": "f'(x)=2x·sin x - x^2·cos x"
            },
            {
              "value": "D",
              "label": "f'(x)=x^2·cos x"
            }
          ],
          "answer": [
            "B"
          ],
          "analysis": "函数 f(x)=x^2·sin x 是 x^2 与 sin x 的乘积，应使用积规则：(uv)'=u'v+uv'。令 u=x^2，v=sin x，则 u'=2x，v'=cos x，代入得 f'(x)=2x·sin x+x^2·cos x。选项 A 只对其中一个因子求导并改变了函数名，属于只记符号未对应操作；选项 C 把 v' 误写为 -cos x；选项 D 只对 sin x 求导，忽略了对 x^2 求导及乘积结构。",
          "points": 10,
          "knowledgePointIds": [
            "GH-04-K02"
          ],
          "cognitiveLevel": "apply",
          "estimatedSteps": 3,
          "pairId": "GH-04-K02-check",
          "adaptiveRole": "core",
